      "description": "Track your heart in real time, right from your wrist. This app requires an Apple Watch, and includes the watch app free.\n\nThis app shows live heart rate with a smooth scrolling graph, along with key cardio signals like energy burn, breathing rate, and variability, designed for clarity at a glance.\n\nBuilt for Apple Watch first, it focuses on continuous monitoring, not workouts. No clutter, no sessions to manage — just instant feedback on how your body is responding moment to moment. An optional iPhone companion mirrors your data on a larger screen.\n\nPerfect for casual fitness, stress awareness, or simple curiosity about your heart throughout the day.\n\n\nThe app comes with a companion watch app you need to run at the same time.",
